1.3 Willful Defaulters & Non-Cooperative Borrowers:
Zero credit exposure is permitted to entities or directors appearing on RBI/CIBIL willful defaulters or
suit-filed lists. No compromise or restructuring without Special High-Powered Board Committee clearance.
